criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Signing of informed consent;
* Patients of both sexes, aged ≥18 years;
* Patients with relapsed/refractory DLBCL (including transformed indolent lymphoma with subsequent DLBCL recurrence) after at least one prior chemo-immonotherapy including anti-CD20 drug;
* Patients with documented CD19 expression (by immunohistochemistry \[IHC\] or flow cytometry \[FCM\]) in lymphoma cells;
* Patients not candidates for high-dose chemotherapy with hematopoietic stem cell auto transplantation or CAR-T therapy;.
* Washout period following treatment with cytotoxic T-cell drugs before peripheral blood collection for CIK\_D332 cell manufacturing:

  * minimum 2 weeks from systemic chemotherapy and targeted agents
  * minimum 12 weeks from lymphotoxic therapy (Bendamustine, Fludarabine, Cladribine, Pentostatin, loncastuximab, CAR-T)
  * minimum 7 days stop from corticosteroids
  * 2-4 weeks stop from immunosuppressants (e.g., for GVHD).

Exclusion Criteria:

* ● Patients with known active malignancy;

  * Patients with a positive test for human immunodeficiency virus (HIV) or active hepatitis B or C;
  * Patients with active autoimmune disease requiring systemic treatment
  * Woman who is pregnant or breastfeeding or expecting to conceive or father children within the projected duration of the study;
  * Patients suffering from Burkitt's lymphoma, aggressive lymphoma with rearrangement of MYC, BCL2 or BCL6;
  * Patients with \> 4 lines of therapy for lymphoma;
  * Patients with known hypersensitivity to study antibodies, Human Serum Albumin (HSA), Dimethyl Sulfoxide (DMSO) or any formulation excipients of CIK\_D332;
  * Patients with medical or psychological conditions that prevent participation;
  * Active, uncontrolled systemic bacterial, viral, fungal, or parasitic infections;.
  * Severe baseline organ failure (NYHA Class III/IV cardiac dysfunction, hepatic impairment with total bilirubin \> 2.0× ULN, or renal failure with CrCl \< 30 mL/min);.
  * Administration of live attenuated vaccines within 6 months prior to or following CIK\_D332 cell infusion.
